[{"title":"暑夜孝若携伎饮长桥上同诸从踏月歌","author":"吴梦旸","text":"明月满地寒如霜，踏歌出门气扬扬。\n登桥仰面天苍茫，千峰万峰挂女墙。\n酒星客星为低昂，老夫兴好君相当。\n阿浑阿咸底复狂，袒跣大叫呼索郎。\n长须仡仡催行觞，甘瓜碧藕压酒浆。\n其时妖冶谁为将，黄衫宕子青楼倡。\n绛纱引出差饬妆，氍毹狼籍脂泽芗。\n娇歌忽转《妩媚娘》，《前溪》、《采菱》音旋亡。\n入宫变徵吾未遑，坐来白露涂衣裳。\n鬓毛刁骚肌骨凉，乌栖月黑还洞房。\n博山烟灭灯无光，蟋蟀当户逼人床。\n欢乐继之慨以慷，悄然无寝夜未央，徘徊中庭何所望。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1814,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏玄成邀集中园歌","author":"吴梦旸","text":"君胡为乎衡门下，偃卧中园号桑者。\n满床图史安得贫，鸭阑鹤栅供萧洒。\n比邻大贾谁过从，柴桑篮舆多从容。\n生徒散去亦不索，退院老僧方打钟。\n我独来寻一二友，如君悠悠吾且朽。\n烹葵剥枣饶盘餐，不妨案头权设酒。\n有酒便堪酬酒徒，白头能傍酒家胡。\n人间何许快意事，大叫一掷成枭卢。\n清商旧谱新声续，还唱江南《采菱曲》。\n曲声半落风雨边，人影蹒跚灭华烛。\n今人之乐乐未央，古人一往谁能将。\n我怀古人色凋丧，出门空觅江都相。\n荒丘野蔓谁家宫，玉钩斜上吹凄风。\n欲将衰白变美好，八公山上皆青草。\n何如诸公达者为，使我一饮成淋漓。\n客散吾留雨如注，好君正在萧飒处。\n还将旧事仔细论，惟有邗江之上潮来去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1815,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同潘景升顾嘿孙集湖上代妓作","author":"吴梦旸","text":"妾家白门杨柳下，杨柳当年系郎马。\n又住钱塘杨柳边，杨柳仍藏乌哑哑。\n生憎哑哑乌，逐郎郎在湖，聊复为郎提玉壶。\n泛月月未起，萧萧一湖水。\n向月人人道有情，未见情人为情死。\n君不见白使君苏使君，一呼小蛮一朝云。\n今日妾歌《懊恼》词，借问使君闻不闻？\n无端再唱《金陵》乐，若个天涯不流落。\n好认西湖是妾家，南屏山前多藕花。\n藕花折郎手，花飘不得藕。\n心知郎有他，为郎来劝酒。\n一诉姊妹知，不如诉郎友。\n将寻小小过西陵，月落天低江渡口。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1816,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张去华走哭汝阳王胤昌宫庶","author":"吴梦旸","text":"君不见南州孺子辟不起，一朝徒步走千里。\n英雄但可轻浮名，那可无心报知己。\n张郎心事亦复然，絮酒持将哭泉里。\n自言不受他人知，惟有汝阳王庶子。\n出门满路吹蒺藜，眼底谁为此人死。\n更将肝胆何处明，一片悲风咽汝水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1817,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过友人花下歌","author":"吴梦旸","text":"忆昔曾醉故人家，满檐春雪吹梨花。\n花开花落今几度，为问客颜得如故。\n故人老去犹故心，折花忆我相思深。\n重来看花花益好，可惜看花人尽老。\n此时花里春风颠，此时沽酒莫论钱。\n当杯但畏花欲落，且向花前同醉眠。\n若过君家能醉杀，便须埋我在花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1818,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑冬曹能始过客孝若斋中因遍游吴兴诸山歌以美之","author":"吴梦旸","text":"君胡为兮乐吾土，临水登山吊今古。\n故鄣城外君回船，诗中不吊陈霸先。\n关中布衣呼不起，挂瓢堂中君独倚。\n悄然忧来不可辍，长谣短咏皆奇绝。\n冻云不收天雨雪，雪皎天青照颜色。\n其时值我不出关，今年相趁控鹤还。\n劝君入官官复闲，萧萧肃肃山水间。\n嗟嗟！\n古人骨已折，今人谁与友？\n心忆臧三梦吴九，不别茅维重携手。\n山水风流或在兹，一日遂为君所有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1819,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相逢行别朱大复比部","author":"吴梦旸","text":"请君为我止，听我《相逢行》。\n相逢恍若昧平生，颜色可疑心事明。\n但云两人天所成，安能百岁无合并。\n眼中不觉乡国远，一日携手长安城。\n因之齿牙及余子，臧三无聊董大死。\n饶他独好蓬蒿人，复使区区入君耳。\n与君各抱龙门桐，朱弦九绝非不工。\n今君将使《大雅》作，吾亦为君扬《国风》。\n洋洋入人无上下，君方在朝吾在野。\n纵君寡合我更穷，忍向悠悠希作者。\n作者有如君，吾何怨幽独。\n即来遗我珠十斛，用之字字荒年谷。\n无端别掷书一行，我正悲酸不能读。\n直从野夫论时事，其间奚止三痛哭。\n野夫痛哭思上书，忧愤不知臣分疏。\n君谓斯言胡草草，在君言之犹患早。\n况乃祢生衣褐衣，眇小谁容言是非。\n所惜为郎不赐见，岂其遂忘巨鹿战。\n一论往事心胆寒，更无长策求治安。\n皇华漫咏日出处，鲸鲵昼夜兴狂澜。\n相沿犹号女主国，叛逆底须勤县官。\n及今所恃在天险，慎勿苟且遗三韩。\n斯言特地向君吐，知君矫矫存忠肝。\n嗟嗟壮士无由得，濒海经营汤信国。\n其时训诰绝岛夷，卓矣高皇先远识。\n乾坤全仗开辟功，亿载绵绵由帝力。\n近日曾颁罪己诏，俄顷河山尽增色。\n明朝送子去朝天，自今更始理必然。\n人人建白惟恐后，中有几人如子贤。\n世上无非子能事，不忍使子名空传。\n野夫高枕娱白日，何妨音响相周旋。\n所思在此劳梦寤，合眼已睹中兴年。\n梦来原识到家路，参差芳草衡门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1820,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为钟清叔题薛五兰卷","author":"吴梦旸","text":"薛五嫁人苦不早，皆知倡家擅技巧。\n写生乃是第一技，所见无如此卷好。\n蕙质兰心有深寄，叶叶茎茎吐幽思。\n其余点缀亦复佳，剡藤数丈披清气。\n画兼题咏频致余，余亦每呼薛较书。\n居然独立脂粉外，芗泽全抛弦索疏。\n通国名娃出其下，仍嗟举世无知者。\n眼中钟叔比钟期，此卷只应遗叔也。\n叔也有情情复起，我题情语情如水。\n枉教梦到湘江头，湘江水绝兰枯死。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1821,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捕鱼词","author":"吴梦旸","text":"钱唐萧萧暮潮响，雪片打船天苍莽。\n此时江心鱼不上，渔郎视鱼如在掌。\n身跃水底胜落网，手擎一尾一尺广。\n回身落水水几丈，俄顷出没鱼穰穰。\n起立船头发蔽颡，不着衣裳还打桨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1822,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同周叔隐夜坐","author":"吴梦旸","text":"罢酒尚寒色，颓然拥衲衣。\n洞萧吹雨歇，残烛映江微。\n道路人将老，乡园梦不违。\n连朝常少睡，支枕问清晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1823,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东生湛园","author":"吴梦旸","text":"道路谈丘壑，惟于此地亲。\n了无尘事到，各有土风陈。\n池集常来鸟，花窥将去人。\n烛销仍缱绻，半为惜残春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1824,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱简栖驾月园","author":"吴梦旸","text":"所欣连夕燕，世事不曾论。\n得与时人远，常如往者存。\n异书抽秘府，嘉树看邻园。\n忘却春将半，飞花吹入门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1825,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邀诸友集顾所建湖上水阁","author":"吴梦旸","text":"相趁探春去，琴尊一为携。\n花繁那辨树，湖荡不分堤。\n老益希新好，闲能补旧题。\n酒家知在否，烟雨段桥迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1826,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆纂甫至","author":"吴梦旸","text":"北归重得见，未暇道相思。\n国计今如此，吾徒何可为。\n暑禁寒雨积，老任落花吹。\n剩有衔杯兴，君还进茗糜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对客","author":"吴梦旸","text":"举世悠悠者，都非君所从。\n有人相许可，垂老一从容。\n小雨披群竹，清霜劲老松。\n别无相对语，墙角远闻蛩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋日赵文度过小饮","author":"吴梦旸","text":"相逢说牢落，况乃值清秋。\n满地已黄叶，他乡应白头。\n酒边愁较缓，身外老堪休。\n为赠青天月，须君尽日留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1829,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姚百雉见访","author":"吴梦旸","text":"一杯缘尔设，心曲直须陈。\n花下何由老，吟边那得贫。\n史无磨镜事，客有卖浆人。\n似此谁闻得，惟应向我频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1830,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄贞父北上","author":"吴梦旸","text":"期君向所负，今出果何如。\n明主争为用，高名善自居。\n有身须事业，无意即樵渔。\n朋旧同闻此，长安不寄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1831,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送胡孟韬邑博之沅江","author":"吴梦旸","text":"携手情无极，茫茫此别何。\n一官犹俎豆，满地已干戈。\n畏路身难定，骚人怨自多。\n可堪寥落思，木叶洞庭波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1832,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拨闷对翁晋简义公","author":"吴梦旸","text":"莫遣秋来兴，阴晴坐郁蒸。\n茶铛虞水竭，书帙尽尘凝。\n老眼何由放，诸山久不登。\n因之怀旧好，几个白头僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1833,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都下寄龙君御","author":"吴梦旸","text":"及此赐环日，敢遗招隐诗。\n贾生流涕易，嵇叔入官迟。\n治粟缘时急，藏书许客知。\n武陵花不落，恐误出山期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1834,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得曹能始白门书却寄","author":"吴梦旸","text":"务求千古合，宁与一时乖。\n此语无人道，安能不尔怀。\n闲情陶顾渚，旧梦怯秦淮。\n所可遥相慰，春来风日佳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1835,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留赠老僧","author":"吴梦旸","text":"闻师日静坐，烦恼静中除。\n燕子邻家去，僧雏别院居。\n岭云归复尽，山果落将疏。\n犹有相关事，溪头值老渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1836,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼爱师","author":"吴梦旸","text":"几度寻师到，茫然空自回。\n所闻无一了，安用此重来。\n江月为心印，庭花俨手栽。\n尚勤诸弟子，香火影堂开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1837,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过严寅所村居","author":"吴梦旸","text":"相期殊有谓，相见且无言。\n不使钱刀尽，安知意气存。\n菰芦聊四户，灯火自孤村。\n最好交游绝，诸山在筚门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1838,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同翁晋还自吴门志别","author":"吴梦旸","text":"明朝子解去，昨日送茅维。\n芳草犹在望，素心还自持。\n旅魂花片片，人影髻丝丝。\n近日情如许，那为万里悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1839,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罢读","author":"吴梦旸","text":"残书且罢读，兀坐夕阳轩。\n睡去入松影，醒来通鸟言。\n身闲衰老骨，事少暮冬村。\n忽作窗前雨，苍苍云气屯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1840,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮翁升小楼同翁晋作","author":"吴梦旸","text":"开尊谁是主，但饮不须疑。\n密坐皆无次，同来似有期。\n溪山留客易，风雨下楼迟。\n别后还相忆，梅花怅满枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1841,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上同晋叔默孙作","author":"吴梦旸","text":"心赏无过杯酒间，良朋难合复追攀。\n重寻往事浑如梦，好藉清谈一解颜。\n秋杪细听将坠叶，月斜犹傍未沉山。\n请看临别萧萧影，几度残钟拂署还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1842,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨仲明见访有赠","author":"吴梦旸","text":"材僻相将学课农，犹烦朋旧远过从。\n出门觅取谁家酒，隔水闻来何寺钟。\n往日姓名疑剑侠，近来乡曲号书佣。\n自夸兴到还多事，手植荒庭一老松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1843,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅新春对客作","author":"吴梦旸","text":"泻尽流澌春气温，一溪新涨旧柴门。\n野僧同住权为寺，水鸟孤飞不出村。\n瓦鼎只应烹腊雪，藜床最好傍朝暾。\n过从总在沧江上，安有平生未吐言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1844,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送戚不磷之内黄访邓远游","author":"吴梦旸","text":"野夫元是客中身，复向离堂易损神。\n鸟哢一声林已夕，花吹三月路无春。\n黄河不接黎阳树，青草偏生杨子津。\n非尔中年急知己，那能轻作渡江人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1845,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"散社后示诸子兼辞酒会","author":"吴梦旸","text":"苏晋长斋列饮中，留连聊与故人同。\n生憎情剧三眠柳，徒自身轻半死桐。\n细草忽随春浪碧，远山浑入夕阳空。\n无端觅得桃花枕，一觉悠悠答昼公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1846,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过张孟育话旧","author":"吴梦旸","text":"读书无遇不能休，一话穷途客自留。\n飒飒枯枝霜满树，微微残腊夜登楼。\n二三知己皆黄土，几个生徒又白头。\n如许老怀那遣得，到门湖水日悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1847,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过愚公虎丘寺","author":"吴梦旸","text":"烹葵剥枣尽相关，坐到昏钟始下山。\n弟子可知皆白足，老夫焉得不苍颜。\n花飞日日何曾扫，柳长村村只未攀。\n路黑出门灯肯借，画船箫鼓几家还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己酉新春二首 其一","author":"吴梦旸","text":"自拟今春怀抱开，林扉时复扫荒苔。\n沙头鸥鸟休飞去，野外梅花许折来。\n多少误人空识字，从容留客不衔杯。\n题书遍问诸名胜，肯入庐山般若台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己酉新春二首 其二","author":"吴梦旸","text":"百年何负草堂灵，讵使寻常问客星。\n不种公田仍减产，尚无饥色喜添丁。\n人间安用屠龙技，方外曾携相鹤经。\n空手出门风雨至，也须蓑笠问樵青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋草","author":"吴梦旸","text":"八月幽并百草黄，还闻一曲奏清商。\n关河今夜皆寒色，陵寝前朝但夕阳。\n久客自然迷道路，后时能不畏风霜。\n吴儿莫说漂零易，未到边头古战场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别黄伯传","author":"吴梦旸","text":"但作寻常别，不作寻常语。\n夜深江月来，还疑未别汝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊","author":"吴梦旸","text":"老屋如巢居，亦复御风雨。\n中有独坐人，焉知不可语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"吴梦旸","text":"江上元无暑，凉风暑尽收。\n鬓毛吹已短，还度几回秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再遇汪景纯","author":"吴梦旸","text":"金陵乐府杜秋娘，宛转新声隐洞房。\n林木尽飞江水咽，那教人听不回肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴翁晋之官白下","author":"吴梦旸","text":"尔从舍我客东阿，京邑论交长者多。\n今日草深丞相宅，莫因肠断不重过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送茅荐卿之官白下","author":"吴梦旸","text":"筹国常存感慨余，一身牢落鬓萧疏。\n官闲勿谓全无事，前岁闻君有谏书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送翁晋东游","author":"吴梦旸","text":"春风常在故人前，为折新花媚别筵。\n恼杀当筵飞片片，可能吹到渡江船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝若将入山送之","author":"吴梦旸","text":"山中多有好生涯，涧户云关不苦赊。\n试觅前朝避兵处，至今犹住几人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送孙子长","author":"吴梦旸","text":"国子先生较广文，高名无地不归君。\n长安难得官如水，只合题书寄白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪明府擢水部北上","author":"吴梦旸","text":"长安谁与说江湖，市上今无旧酒徒。\n祇是同曹茅水部，问侬曾见令君无？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送钱元英请告还乡","author":"吴梦旸","text":"托病还山意有余，今人惟读古人书。\n若然门外无邻近，愿借溪滩学打鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪念潭","author":"吴梦旸","text":"秋山万叠赴新安，清浅溪流五百滩。\n谁向此中深领略，问君何不早辞官？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古道庵望华享","author":"吴梦旸","text":"沿江指遥白云隈，树底空床遍绿苔。\n今夜道人来借宿，前峰先有鹤飞回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈山甫遨集杨姬华林馆同赋四首 其一","author":"吴梦旸","text":"一片清江写远忧，新花还觅旧青楼。\n黄衫谢去诸年少，领略风光几白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈山甫遨集杨姬华林馆同赋四首 其二","author":"吴梦旸","text":"四月探春春已过，他乡行乐莫蹉跎。\n诗家文酒娼家会，弦索全抛翰墨多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈山甫遨集杨姬华林馆同赋四首 其三","author":"吴梦旸","text":"烟花四部旧曾题，迭变新声拍按齐。\n听到关情情忽忽，绛纱休妒翠眉低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈山甫遨集杨姬华林馆同赋四首 其四","author":"吴梦旸","text":"诸郎焉肯负尊罍，临别连呼大白来。\n问我何曾高兴索，满街明月踏歌回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金城禅院","author":"王野","text":"林峦残雪霁，净土独游频。\n鸟似忘机客，山疑入定人。\n灵花飘不尽，古木自无春。\n坐悟衣珠在，空经累劫贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访王伯谷","author":"王野","text":"流水方穷处，茅堂空自开。\n鸟啼春树绿，花发故人来。\n白日待将夕，青山去未回。\n题门吾岂敢，此意寄莓苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪曲","author":"王野","text":"大漠雪漫漫，胡风入箭瘢。\n平明没马足，半夜折旌竿。\n声叠鼓鼙暗，光添剑戟寒。\n铁衣三十万，谁不忆长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越中送僧还旧山","author":"王野","text":"折柳插瓶溪水湾，此方缘尽又思还。\n春花乞食云门寺，秋叶翻经瓦屋山。\n云起珠林封旧迹，月临宝地忆慈颜。\n知君身似旃檀树，已去留香梵宇间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征夫怨","author":"王野","text":"黄云白草没燕山，百战空存两鬓斑。\n不识征夫三十万，几人生入玉门关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词","author":"王野","text":"江上春深万万枝，含枝带雨尽低垂。\n不知此物关何事，今古令人怨别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄叔祖仲房","author":"王野","text":"燕赵归来二十春，重游吴楚白头新。\n如今海内无知己，到处江世哭故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]